  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"按执行顺序：1）Sentence Segmentation；2）Graph Retrieval；3）Inference。[chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de] 作者称这三阶段分别用于“breaking down sentences, sourcing related graph elements, and reaching reasoned outcomes”。[chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de]\\n\\n句子分割阶段把句子划分成对应单一关系的子句，以利于在多跳任务中识别各子句里的关系。[chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c] 文中还说明，每个子句 Si 由实体集合 Ei 与关系 ri 组成。[chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c]\\n\\n图检索阶段先检索可能连接子句内实体的关系池，再结合这些关系和实体集得到候选证据图（子 KG）池。[chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760] 结论段将其功能概括为“sourcing related graph elements”。[chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de]\\n\\n推理阶段利用所得图导出逻辑结论，例如验证给定断言或回答问题。[chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760] 结论段对应表述为“reaching reasoned outcomes”。[chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de]\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_45c598ca774c47ab2be0c3b734efd4de\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_e702747b8cb7850698f65ab65a3d7d8c\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_a4963bc9a949cc8fa87d1c46b7c95760\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"}],\"status\":\"ok\"}",
